# Build output
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/dist/
*.binlog

# Thunderstore packaging output (the zips are uploaded, not committed)
**/thunderstore/*.zip
**/thunderstore/stage/
**/thunderstore/icon_source.png

# Game and BepInEx assemblies copied in for building
**/lib/

# Third-party mods patched locally for the test profile
patched-plugins/
.quarantine/

# IDE and OS clutter
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.swp
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Scratch
*.tmp
*.log

# Specifications are working documents, not shipped artefacts
**/SPEC.md
**/SPEC-*.md

# The clean room is build scaffolding, not the product: the Docker image, the slice specs,
# the per-pass source archives and the run logs. The mod itself lives in its own folder.
cleanroom/

# Clean-room agent working notes, not part of the mod
DECISIONS.md

# Local agent configuration - machine-specific, not shared
.claude/
